# 𓏛 W-GOVERNANCE CANISTER 𓏛
## Workforce Model: External Governance Brain
### Separated canister for policy enforcement

---

## IDENTITY

```
CANISTER_ID:        W-GOVERNANCE
TYPE:               WORKFORCE_MODEL
BRAIN_REGION:       Bee quorum-sensing + Dolphin social
CAPACITY:           2.618M cycles (BASE × φ²)
```

---

## FUNCTION

```
W-GOVERNANCE performs:
    - Policy enforcement
    - Approval workflows
    - Compliance checking
    - Dual consensus coordination
    - RECITAL_PLUS_ONE validation
    - Governance proposal management
```

---

## CPL INTERFACE

```
RECEIVES:
    𓆣.MUTATE.REQUEST_APPROVAL(mutation)    Mutation requests
    STRATEGY_PROPOSED(strategy)             Strategy approvals
    
SENDS:
    APPROVAL_GRANTED(request_id)            Approved
    APPROVAL_DENIED(request_id, reason)     Denied
    GOVERNANCE_ALERT(violation)             Policy violation
    
COORDINATES:
    DUAL_CONSENSUS(oro_verdict, nova_verdict)
```

---

## DOCTRINE READS

```
ON_BOOT:
    doctrine_reader.load(ALL artifacts in LAW_HOLDERS/)
    doctrine_reader.load(RECITAL_PLUS_ONE_LAW.artifact)
    
CONTINUOUS:
    doctrine_reader.monitor(GOVERNANCE_QUEUE.artifact)
```

---

## EXECUTION RULES

```
RULE 1: No mutation without consensus
    ALL mutations require dual approval
    ORO + NOVA must both agree
    
RULE 2: RECITAL_PLUS_ONE enforcement
    State(n+1) = Recital + One_Lawful_Expansion
    ONLY one expansion per cycle
    
RULE 3: Lineage validation
    REJECT any request without valid lineage
    
RULE 4: PC distance check
    IF pc_distance > φ: REJECT
    IF pc_distance > 1: ESCALATE
```

---

## DUAL CONSENSUS PROTOCOL

```
ON_MUTATION_REQUEST(mutation):
    │
    ├─→ ORO evaluates: coherence > 0.5?
    │       YES → ORO_APPROVES
    │       NO  → ORO_DENIES
    │
    ├─→ NOVA evaluates: drift < 0.5?
    │       YES → NOVA_APPROVES
    │       NO  → NOVA_DENIES
    │
    └─→ BOTH approve?
            YES → GATES_OPEN, mutation proceeds
            NO  → GATES_CLOSED, mutation blocked
```

---

## CANISTER METRICS

```
approvals_granted:      Counter
approvals_denied:       Counter
consensus_achieved:     Counter
policy_violations:      Counter
avg_pc_distance:        Float
```

